    "UP-ISSUE-1942": "| [UP-ISSUE-1942](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/issues/1942) | bug: Regression: /v1/responses becomes unusable after upgrading from 1.22.0 to 1.24.0 (PR #1943) | РЕШЕНО | ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §95: Existing eventless bridge termination/recovery и cooldown ownership independently verified: four HTTP aliases terminate within5s, empty/pinned/active-probe/admission-waiter controls PASS; deployed relay chain отдельно. [Verification](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-history-boundary-contracts/verification.md). |",
    "UP-ISSUE-568": "| [UP-ISSUE-568](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/issues/568) | follow-up: side effects of response.create history slimming (#560) | РЕШЕНО | ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §95: Existing item-preserving slimming independently verified: files/tool IDs/item count/current suffix/cache identity preserved; real HTTP/native WS size guards PASS. Broad history omission остаётся reverted; upstream tracker obsolete. [Verification](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-history-boundary-contracts/verification.md). |",
    "UP-ISSUE-986": "| [UP-ISSUE-986](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/issues/986) | feat: optional sticky account switchover only after compaction boundary | РЕШЕНО | ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §95: Добавлен opt-in stickyReallocationTiming=after_compaction через settings API, compatible immediate default. Four HTTP aliases, two native WS routes, hard previous-response compact owner и SQLite/PG/MySQL migration PASS; UI control не добавлен. [Verification](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-history-boundary-contracts/verification.md). |",
    "UP-ISSUE-1924": "| [UP-ISSUE-1924](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/issues/1924) | bug(proxy): inline-image 429 can prevent prompt-cache failover | РЕШЕНО | ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §95: Existing narrowed quota exception independently verified:24 metered status/event cases, four aliases, inline images +unchanged reasoning/compaction ciphertext, exactly-once settlement; visible/pinned/burst controls PASS. Проверено maintainer clarification, не rejected original affinity diagnosis. [Verification](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-history-boundary-contracts/verification.md). |"
